OL,3,GNEWSAHow can Guernsey prepare for a
OL,4,Ahotter future?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the People and Nature
OL,7,FSurvey, run by the island's Nature
OL,8,FCommission in 2025, of the more than
OL,9,F900 respondents 44% said climate change
OL,10,Fwas a significant concern - making it
OL,11,Fthe second largest concern recorded in
OL,12,Fthe survey, after development and land
OL,13,Fuse.
